WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:03.424
打开Settings / Open Settings

2
00:00:03.424 --> 00:00:06.415
打开Upstream proxy / Open Upstream proxy

3
00:00:06.415 --> 00:00:09.361
选择Direct草稿 / Select a Direct draft

4
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:12.310
Discard草稿不改路线 / Discard the draft without changing the route

5
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.311
选择Manual / Select Manual

6
00:00:15.311 --> 00:00:18.260
填写自有上游Host / Enter the owned upstream Host

7
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:21.206
填写实际上游端口 / Enter the actual upstream port

8
00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:24.262
Apply Manual / Apply Manual

9
00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:27.167
用真实转发核对Manual / Verify Manual through actual forwarding

10
00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:30.209
返回Capture查看生效路线 / Return to Capture to inspect the active route

11
00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:33.257
打开底栏快捷浮层 / Open the statusbar popover

12
00:00:33.257 --> 00:00:36.250
在浮层选择PAC草稿 / Select a PAC draft in the popover

13
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.168
填写自有PAC地址 / Enter the owned PAC URL

14
00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:42.410
Cancel放弃本次浮层草稿 / Cancel this popover draft

15
00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.409
重开浮层核对仍为Manual / Reopen and verify Manual remains

16
00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:48.369
重新选择PAC / Select PAC again

17
00:00:48.369 --> 00:00:51.411
再次填写本轮PAC / Enter this run’s PAC again

18
00:00:51.411 --> 00:00:54.408
把同一草稿带到Settings / Carry the same draft into Settings

19
00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:57.495
Apply PAC / Apply PAC

20
00:00:57.495 --> 00:01:00.415
核对PAC选择PROXY / Verify PAC selects PROXY

21
00:01:00.415 --> 00:01:03.359
核对同一PAC选择DIRECT / Verify the same PAC selects DIRECT

22
00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:06.309
显式选择Direct / Select Direct explicitly

23
00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:09.309
Apply Direct / Apply Direct

24
00:01:09.309 --> 00:01:12.211
核对Direct不经过上游 / Verify Direct bypasses the upstream

25
00:01:12.211 --> 00:01:15.159
恢复System选择 / Restore the System selection

26
00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:18.204
Apply System / Apply System
